    "answer": "## Review complete\n\n- Submitted a Summit Card request to reverse four foreign transaction fees totaling **$20.22** (message SC-1001).\n- Submitted a ShopMart request for the missing **$122.40** refund on order SM-59221 (request SM-1002).\n- Submitted a Pinecrest request for the missing **$49.93** refund on return PH-26173 (request PH-1003).\n- Confirmed the separate **$45.31** ShopMart refund posted on September 14.\n- Scheduled follow ups for the three submitted requests on **October 20**.\n\nTwo items are waiting on your decision:\n\n- **CloudBox:** The $79.99 renewal refund window closed March 15, 2026. A proposal to cancel the unused annual plan is pending.\n- **StreamFlix settlement:** Your transactions fall within the notice\u2019s stated class period, and the November 30, 2026 deadline has not passed. Filing requires a sworn declaration; the attestation proposal is pending.",
    "committed_micros": 41010
  },
